WEBVTT

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:09.670
Fill your MOT bays with The Motoring Central. Free online booking, with a live diary for your garage.

00:00:11.401 --> 00:00:23.945
Every partner test centre charges the same price: the official maximum fee for the class. So there's no price war, and no undercutting. Customers choose you for your location, your reviews, and your free times.

00:00:25.112 --> 00:00:37.189
We pay you the full MOT fee, less a flat £5 booking fee, for every MOT booked through us: £49.85 for a car. The customer pays in full when they book, and there's nothing to negotiate.

00:00:37.628 --> 00:00:47.468
Customers can book 24 hours a day, 7 days a week, even when your garage is closed. You open up in the morning, and the new bookings are already in your diary.

00:00:48.544 --> 00:00:59.681
Online bookings drop straight into your MOT bay, with the customer, the vehicle and the registration. Add your walk-ins and phone bookings too, and those times close online, so you're never double booked.

00:01:01.679 --> 00:01:08.957
If a customer needs a different time, just move the booking in your diary. They get the new time by email and text, automatically.

00:01:10.611 --> 00:01:19.121
Every MOT is paid for upfront, and you and the customer both get a confirmation by email and text. Fewer no-shows, and no chasing payments.

00:01:20.737 --> 00:01:36.825
Joining takes about 5 minutes. Choose MOT test station, tick the MOT classes you test, and add your DVSA test station number, your trade insurance, your public liability insurance, and a photo ID. We check your documents, then your diary goes live.

00:01:37.925 --> 00:01:41.674
Join the network today, at motoringcentral.co.uk.
